{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>科技媒體CNET正在對蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo進行持續摺疊耐久性測試，累計摺疊次數已達到67.5萬次。目前已經iPhone Duo出現了異常，在自動摺疊測試裝置的作用下，手機突然無法完全閉合。</strong>如果用手將iPhone Duo合上，機身仍能正常閉合，但重新使用測試裝置後，問題又會再次出現。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588160.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.356312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_hash":"0909c5ba0dd9eaf5a96eb18c9c729b8445f4dfede57adedd9e796d5708692a4d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}